Subject: [PATCH] 3106 (speed): the open goal is read beside the trail being
 saved

The goal's ask lines under a reply read the thread's open goal and then its
asks, two round trips after the run's trail was saved. The run loop is over
when the post-run starts, so the goal is read then, beside the trail, and
handed to withGoalAskLines. A failed read is still handled there as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
